<h1>Abdelnasser Rashid</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 21st District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.rashidforillinois.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (rashidforillinois.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>His campaign site says he is focused on affordability, good-paying jobs, and protecting the community from what it calls Trump&#39;s attacks. His bio there says he is working to root out corruption, fund public education, and change a property tax system he describes as favoring large corporations over working families.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Held government and organizing roles in affordable housing and immigrant rights advocacy before his 2022 election; holds a Harvard B.A. and a University of Chicago Booth MBA.</p>
